   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Plastic recycling mini-system for TUM Campus</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Cie&#x13e;om mikrograntu je uk&#xe1;za&#x165; &#x161;tudentom i &#x161;irokej verejnosti r&#xf4;zne mo&#x17e;nosti vyu&#x17e;itia recyklovan&#xfd;ch plastov. Najv&#xfd;znamnej&#x161;ou &#x10d;as&#x165;ou projektu je n&#xe1;kup technologick&#xfd;ch zariaden&#xed; na recykl&#xe1;ciu plastov&#xe9;ho odpadu.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to build a mini/system for plastic recycling on the university campus of Technical University to promote the separation of plastics and plastic recycling.</narrative>
  </description>
